# "Whenever Questing Beast deals combat damage to an opponent, it deals that much damage to target planeswalker that player controls": three
# players. Bot3 controls a Wrenn and Six, Bot2 controls no planeswalker. The Beast (cast with haste on turn 4) attacks Bot2 and deals 4:
# Bot2 has no planeswalker, and Bot3's is not "that player's", so the trigger has no target and Wrenn and Six keeps all 3 loyalty.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Gleemox
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Questing Beast
Plains x4
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x14

[Bot3 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Wrenn and Six
Plains x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T3 Bot3.Main1]
Bot3.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot3.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot3.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot3.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot3.Hand.Wrenn and Six.Cast
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
